      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.13,
      "end_seconds": 254.65,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Okay, so my impression is this: The most likely explanation is a possible stroke, within the treatment window."
